# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Operational notes
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This fragment is the canonical copy of the cleanup entry. The ops team
# compares the fragment against the deployed cron entry during every
# maintenance window to confirm the two match exactly.
#
# If the fragment and the deployed entry disagree, the runbook says to fix
# the deployed entry, not the fragment.
#
# Keep the fragment in the home directory. The production path for the
# deployed entry is /etc/cron.d/.
